& [Shape]
  + one pure cantor_core module accepts strict supplied data and emits an immutable sequence of restoration witnesses plus the final admitted basis

& [Comparison]
  + reachable recovery sources select zero one or conflicting exact frames; P0 compares canonical bytes and never asks a model to declare semantic equivalence

& [Search]
  + lexicographic single then grouped candidate enumeration is checked bounded monotone and can claim only local irreducibility when fully exhausted

& [Evidence]
  + bounded fixture and verifier CLIs retain request envelope verification and evidence manifest for independent byte replay

& [NonEffect]
  + source and recovery values are data; production has no I/O provider inference activation or autonomous continuation capability

& [Next]
  + publish signed formation before Rust then implement and prove the provider-free waist before any prompt projection or live experiment
